{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "0ec36729-6f1c-88b8-ad72-4829fe9e7f0d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-13T10:34:54-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Wilson Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Morning, Kevin. Yeah, I'm calling about a storm drain. I'm on speaker, I've got my hands full, so tell me if I'm breaking up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:28:53-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're coming through fine. Go ahead, what's going on with the drain?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:00-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so, first, it's gurgling. Second, there's a sewer smell coming up out of it, really strong. And third, this is not the first time, it does this every time we get a big rain, and nothing ever gets done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Gotcha. Gurgling, sewer smell. And this is after the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:26-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The coastal storm, Friday into Saturday. That was three days ago and it's still gurgling. Water's gone down but the smell hasn't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. What's the address, so I can put it in right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "399 Farewell Street, in the North End. The drain is right out front by the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:29:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "399 Farewell, North End, curb out front. Writing that down. Is the drain itself blocked with leaves or trash, or does it look clear?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:30:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "First, it looks clear, I checked. Second, I'm not sticking my hand in there. It's not the grate, it's something down below. And there's one more thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:30:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a manhole cover a few feet from the drain that looks off. Like it's sitting an inch higher on one side. Maybe it got pushed during the storm, I don't know. Cars hit it and it clunks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:30:37-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a manhole cover not sitting flush, about an inch off, near the drain. I'll note that as a second item so they look at both. Is it in the travel lane or by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's in the lane, a little toward the middle. So people swerve around it, or they don't and it clunks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:31:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. That one's worth getting looked at quickly. Any water coming up through the manhole itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:31:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No water out of the manhole. Just the drain gurgling and the smell. [pause] Sorry, I've got the radio on, let me turn that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:31:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Sounds like you've got something going."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:31:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Old radio dramas. I put them on while I do chores. Anyway. Back to the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:31:38-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. So I've got the drain gurgling with sewer odor, and the cover sitting high. Anything else, like water backing into a house or yard?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:31:50-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not into our place, no. But the smell comes in when the window's open, and I'm tired of calling about this. Can't somebody just come out and actually fix it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:32:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll get a work order opened on it today, and it goes to the crew that handles drains and sewer lines."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:32:17-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, but what I want to know is, first, will there actually be a work order, and second, what date. Because last time somebody said they'd look into it and I never heard anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:32:34-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, there will be a work order, I'm making it while we talk. For the date, they're still working through a backlog from the storm, so I'd say a few days to a week for someone to get out there. The manhole I'll flag as a safety item so it should get looked at sooner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few days to a week. Okay. Can you give me the work order number so I can reference it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Once it's saved it'll generate one. Let me get your callback number and I'll make sure it's on there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:20-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0185."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:22-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0185. And the name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wilson Semedo. S-E-M-E-D-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wilson Semedo. Are you the owner or renting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:32-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Renting. But the landlord isn't going to do anything about a city drain, that's on you guys."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:33:41-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, the drain in the street is ours. Okay, it's saved. Give me a second, it's coming up. [pause] Alright, I've got it in. I'll read it back. Storm drain at 399 Farewell Street gurgling with sewer smell after the weekend storm, and a manhole cover in the lane sitting about an inch high. Contact Wilson Semedo at that number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. And the date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:34:13-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Target is within the week for the drain. The manhole should be sooner. If you hear nothing by next Tuesday, call back with the number and ask for an update."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:34:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. First, I'll hold you to that. Second, if the smell gets worse, I'll call again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, call anytime. And if the cover shifts more or becomes a hazard for cars, let us know right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:34:47-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-13T10:34:50-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it, Wilson. Take care."
    }
  ],
